OL,3,GNEWSATeam set to return to home stadium
OL,4,Aafter two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's football team will play at
OL,7,Ftheir home ground for the first time in
OL,8,Fmore than two years following previous
OL,9,Ffinancial struggles.
OL,11,FReading Women will take on Fleet at
OL,12,FReading's Select Car Leasing Stadium on
OL,13,FSunday, their first game there since
OL,14,F2024.
OL,16,FThey were demoted to the fifth tier of
OL,17,Fwomen's football weeks later after
OL,18,Fwithdrawing from the second tier, the
OL,19,FChampionship, because of Reading's
OL,20,Ffinancial uncertainty at the time.
